# fw_env.config - tells fw_printenv/fw_setenv where U-Boot environment lives.
#
# The AM62Lx SD card U-Boot environment was found at byte offset 0x180000
# by scanning /dev/mmcblk1 for the saved env block.
# Size 0x20000 (128KB) is the standard TI K3 env size.
#
# device        offset      size
/dev/mmcblk1    0x180000    0x20000
